#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:1534
msgid ""
"The '`llvm.nvvm.fadd.*`' intrinsics add `%a` and `%b` using the rounding "
"mode selected by `%flag_fp_rnd_mode` and the modifiers present in the "
"intrinsic name. They correspond directly to the `add` PTX instruction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:1540 ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:1606
msgid ""
"`%flag_fp_rnd_mode` selects the rounding mode applied to the result, see "
"{ref}`fp-rounding-modes`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:1543
msgid ""
"The '`.ftz`' modifier flushes subnormal inputs and results to sign-"
"preserving zero. The '`.sat`' modifier performs a saturating addition where "
"the result is clamped to `[0.0, 1.0]` and `NaN` results are flushed to "
"`+0.0f`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:1548 ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:1614
msgid ""
"Not every combination of operand type, rounding mode and modifier maps to a "
"PTX instruction. The supported combinations are:"
