"PTX instructions. These instructions initiate an asynchronous copy of tensor "
"data from shared::cta to global memory (indicated by the `s2g` prefix) in "
"`im2col_w` mode. In this mode, the tensor has to be at least three-"
"dimensional. Unlike the `g2s` variants, there are no im2col_offsets for "
"these intrinsics. The last argument to these intrinsics is a boolean flag, "
